# --- Cython-generated sources are TRACKED, deliberately ---------------------
# lib/axon2/*.c and *.h are committed rather than ignored: MANIFEST.in ships
# them so an sdist builds without Cython installed, and the wheel workflow runs
# cibuildwheel without PYAXON_USE_CYTHON. Do not add ignore rules for them.
# (The original pyaxon repository kept them untracked under lib/axon/, which is
# why earlier revisions of this file listed that now-nonexistent path.)

# --- AXON 2026 working artifacts -----------------------------------------
# Local development/provenance material with no upstream equivalent. Excluded
# from the published package to match the original repository's clean layout.
# To publish any of these instead, delete its line below.
platform-evidence/
release_a12/
